{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "ae375a0110e2773f65421a7f1a621d204661e078c7bfa0ad2cdbfd36d9c0f3c4", "ja": "いつも通りのギラギラ", "zh": "一如既往的耀眼夺目", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2b18c4728d8e926b0c352cf449c6b0088e7e1307c17680f45a605a30e6884a59", "ja": "突然このみに呼び出されたプロデューサーと\nツアーメンバー達。最高の公演にするために\n今からできる事はないか？　と聞かれるが、\n話し合う内に、いつも通りの特別な自分達を\n見せればいいという結論に至る。", "zh": "突然被这个叫出来的制作人和巡演成员们。面对“为了办成最棒的公演，现在有没有什么能做的事？”这一问题，大家在讨论之后得出了结论：只要展现一如既往特别的自己就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a4074dc59b79ceabec895b9313c2e752bafa017fe3c5bacc1fdf47c30acc30e5", "ja": "（このみさんに、大切な話があるということで\n呼び出された。一体なんの話だろう？）", "zh": "（このみ小姐说有重要的事，于是把我叫了过来。究竟是什么事呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "fd6237faa08c0e8f24811152be338c5726c3f77f23a195f7a24e9c1668ccedee", "ja": "ええと……集まれるメンバーは集まってくれたわね。\nみんなありがとう！　実は相談したいことが……", "zh": "那个……能来的成员都到齐了吧。\n谢谢大家！其实我有件事想和大家商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "46447dc4e0a7527505135710c6fd21495eab3134a29cfbbab115d4360eb26a67", "ja": "ケータリングのお菓子のコトでショ？　決めてって、\n{$P$}に言われてたもんネ。", "zh": "是关于餐饮点心的事吧？{$P$}让我来决定来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d4f12b4deb2481129739c543ddf67cb5d6eae22b62d02daa9d7be3f33eb16187", "ja": "そうだな、みんなで選んでくれって。", "zh": "对啊，让大家一起选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "64f4103d5495d1d98d0d2034fe1eccdfe4bf544c18c87ec8ab9ecdcb56095505", "ja": "ワタシはチョコレート系がいいと思うナ～。\n運動の後とか、食べてすぐ元気になれるからネ♪", "zh": "我觉得巧克力类的不错哦～  \n运动之后吃了就能马上恢复精神呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "96a5c82cb889ed01458f87d5d73eab460d712ab71745191763963ce53312074b", "ja": "杏奈は……カレーチップスが、いい、な……。\nおいしい、です……♪", "zh": "杏奈……觉得咖喱薯片，就，很好……。\n很好吃……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "67fe4da5e601b4e016a283d1cb115d14d546de5207d3905f53c213142e0ac3e4", "ja": "違う違う！　そっちも大事だけど、\nもっと、公演に関係すること。", "zh": "不是不是！零食当然也很重要，不过是更和公演有关的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "1da5136d4d30758101dcc62d4a3658c965f83b056f606fd3faef8580210f831c", "ja": "公演ですか……そろそろ、セトリや演出が\n確定する頃ですよね。そっち関係ですか？", "zh": "是演出吗……差不多也该确定演出歌单和舞台效果了吧。是和这些有关吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "510d1634e5e01f6d058ff22c2624ed8fe230f510a67311401cfed91c540086b0", "ja": "そう！　さすが千早ちゃんね。\n演出を見直すなら、最後のタイミングってことなの。", "zh": "没错！不愧是千早。\n要重新调整演出的话，现在就是最后的时机了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "202314f8e70b213000f78e56b0678ae99aa7c90fc9af1b3bae9aca1ee111657e", "ja": "「最高の公演にするために、今からできること」\n……究極の質問よ！　はい、みんな答えて！", "zh": "“为了献上一场最棒的演出，从现在起能做到的事”\n……这可是终极提问哦！来，大家都回答看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "02fb6596771fd40dcc21a875c8ef46a3fe0ec676c728354a6311b9e74fc3d765", "ja": "んと……。\nレッスンを……頑張る……？", "zh": "唔……\n努力……练习……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "2dd56dd9a283446698d224592828fb0939c3c4f32c5b87f1b8872be62c3e4085", "ja": "コンディションは、とっても大事だよネ～。\nよく食べて、よく寝ておくコトかナ！", "zh": "状态可是非常重要的哟～。\n好好吃饭，好好睡觉才行吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "f2b24915fedfcfe524049f96cd58602828630d81f201d95784a63b7c5fd7e999", "ja": "そうね……でも、何よりもまず、楽しむこと。\n私はそう思います。", "zh": "是啊……不过，最重要的是享受其中。\n我是这么认为的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "fb3c1cc1210673f4378f69ba2951206287dce8e7bc42e3b5cf38ef2668d2bbcd", "ja": "んーっ………………全部正解っ！\nさすがみんな、よくわかってるじゃない♪", "zh": "嗯——…………全部正确！\n不愧是大家，都很懂嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "107748fa0211fc1ab6e60b9ffadbb91d5d7f8171ed525caa8af0e14eae957132", "ja": "でも、それだと……いつもと同じ、です。\n最高の公演、なら……何か特別なことが、必要……？", "zh": "但是，那样的话……就和往常一样了。\n如果是最棒的公演……是不是需要一些特别的东西……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "4bb938b6a2aa2fed28869ac5d9de092b00c8fbcdc55574609ce434164a30b048", "ja": "そうよね。今のままだと、普通過ぎるもの。\n特別な何か……もっと、アダルティな……。", "zh": "是啊。照现在这样，实在太普通了。\n特别的什么……更有大人风情的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "18a4fa4d7dee3905ff90959eda709b63c65dda31f393e7e37e89acf86e2143ea", "ja": "待ってください、このみさん。\n特別な何かは、別に必要ないと思いますよ。", "zh": "请等一下，木实小姐。\n我觉得其实不需要什么特别的东西哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "b1425078db8f1f1c514edfc3d19ac2377bcd8791d661476af635ea281bfc823e", "ja": "え？　でも、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "诶？可是，那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f2e48bccdfd43bcc69205a986cb6d068f01128212b24ec7ce7d8ab0555770c80", "ja": "みんなにとっての、いつも同じっていうのは、\n決して普通だっていう意味じゃありません。", "zh": "对大家来说的“始终如一”，\n绝不意味着普通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7f2cbf5484c113db255b813f492bf1996a87b83a885679ee9cb77486eddbd42b", "ja": "傍で見てきたから、誰よりもわかります。\n今までだって、みんなはずっと特別でしたよ。", "zh": "因为一直在身边看着，所以我比任何人都明白。\n直到现在，大家也一直都是特别的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "46497971c66b3ac435e0af755e7ef660e7bbdda2cbcb9e25207714d66b2a8447", "ja": "{$P$}……エヘヘ♪", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "39a1a7b5ae5dfe024ff6a5c98c78b301ea741734c8cec56c1706085163014693", "ja": "だから、いつも通りでいいんです。\nいつも通り、特別なみんなを見せてあげましょう！", "zh": "所以，像平时一样就好。\n让大家看看一如既往、特别的你们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "0208a30783897683e975c8996dc7ec3a913704524707807279865cddce2f8422", "ja": "そっか……うん！　わかったわ。\nいつも通り、ギラギラしていけばいいのね。ウフフ♪", "zh": "这样啊……嗯！我明白了。\n像平时一样，闪闪发光地上场就可以了吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "b8e3abb30743453853af746ddaeff2c4e345866d3caefa3397c20caf92acbffa", "ja": "そうして、今の全力の私たちを見てもらう。\n……それでいいんですね、{$P$}。", "zh": "就这样，让大家看看现在全力以赴的我们。……这样就可以了，对吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4097d91dae331417d10047131aa3cdc1624f8ca9160caeedab219d93498c308a", "ja": "（いつも通り、ギラギラしたみんなを見せる。\nそう、それでいい……ブレたりする必要はないんだ！）", "zh": "（像往常一样，让大家看到闪耀夺目的我们。对，这样就好……没必要动摇！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
